        "nobel_worthiness": "The jamming transition provides an influential way to understand how disordered systems acquire rigidity, linking granular matter, foams, and broader nonequilibrium physics.",
        "attribution": "These researchers made central contributions to framing, testing, and developing the jamming picture, although the field includes substantial work by others.",
        "maturity": "The transition has been studied in simulations, experiments, and theory over a long period, with robust results in defined settings.",
